# Docs

- `docs/` describes intended system behavior; update when implementation diverges.
- Prefer Mermaid for flows/ER diagrams.
- Append roadmap decision log instead of rewriting history silently.
- Cross-link `AGENTS.md` / README when adding a major new doc.
